msgid "Read exact platform support"
msgstr "理解精确平台支持"

msgid ""
"Support has five separate dimensions: chip fact, maintained provider/mode, "
"reviewed Board route, executed software scope and physical station scope. "
"The [derived capability matrix](../../delivery/capabilities.md) owns "
"mode/route/ fixture/source associations. The [support "
"record](../../delivery/support.md) owns current detailed limits; this page "
"explains how to select them."
msgstr ""
"支持分为五个独立维度：芯片事实、维护的提供者/模式、复核 Board "
"路由、实际软件执行范围和物理工位范围。[派生能力矩阵](../../delivery/capabilities.md)拥有模式/路由/夹具/源码关联。[支持记录](../../delivery/support.md)拥有当前详细限制；本页说明如何选择。"

msgid "Platform"
msgstr "平台"

msgid "Maintained selection and essential boundary"
msgstr "维护选择与关键边界"

msgid "Native"
msgstr "Native"

msgid ""
"Independent host models, POSIX behavior and real selected RTOS host tests; "
"no MCU qualification"
msgstr "独立主机模型、POSIX 行为和实际选定 RTOS 主机测试；不建立 MCU 资格"

msgid "F407ZG Qiming / F407VE Sky"
msgstr "F407ZG 启明 / F407VE 天空星"

msgid ""
"Exact M4F parts and separate Board facts; broad explicit F407 modes, "
"baremetal/FreeRTOS and reviewed ThreadX M4 subset"
msgstr "精确 M4F 料号和各自 Board 事实；明确选择广泛 F407 模式、裸机/FreeRTOS 与复核 ThreadX M4 子集"

msgid "F470ZG Liangshan"
msgstr "F470ZG 梁山派"

msgid ""
"Exact GD32 M4F provider and Board; broad explicit modes, baremetal/FreeRTOS "
"and reviewed ThreadX M4 subset"
msgstr "精确 GD32 M4F 提供者与 Board；明确选择广泛模式、裸机/FreeRTOS 与复核 ThreadX M4 子集"

msgid "F103RB / GD303RC references"
msgstr "F103RB / GD303RC 参考"

msgid ""
"Exact legacy GPIO/UART/SPI plus finite channel-DMA UART, IRQ-message I2C, "
"physical Flash, single ADC and fixed PWM; finite RX has rearm gaps and I2C "
"priority-zero IRQs cannot notify a kernel"
msgstr ""
"精确 legacy GPIO/UART/SPI，加有限 channel-DMA UART、IRQ 消息 I2C、物理 Flash、单次 ADC 和固定 "
"PWM；有限 RX 有 rearm 间隙，I2C priority0 IRQ 不能调用内核通知"

msgid "G474RE source reference"
msgstr "G474RE 来源参考"

msgid ""
"GPIO, six IRQ UARTs, polling SPI, fixed PWM, IWDG and EXTI; selected ADC1 "
"bulb-sampling single conversions and finite TIM6 DMA blocks, polling I2C1 "
"and ECC Flash; no continuous ADC or inherited F407 modes"
msgstr ""
"GPIO、六个 IRQ UART、轮询 SPI、固定 PWM、IWDG 和 EXTI；所选 ADC1 bulb 采样单次转换和有限 TIM6 DMA 块、轮询 "
"I2C1 与 ECC Flash；不提供连续 ADC，也不继承 F407 其他模式"

msgid "H743ZI reference selections"
msgstr "H743ZI 参考选择"

msgid ""
"Fixed HSI32/HSI64 and Cache off/on; base selections provide finite USART3 "
"TX DMA or RX DMA-IDLE, optional initialized D2 SRAM1 and selected "
"SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/IWDG/Flash; separate V-revision/HSI64/baremetal/AXI "
"SRAM selections provide continuous USART3 RX or finite TX DMA with "
"continuous RX; Flash requires Cache off; no running-state handoff"
msgstr ""
"固定 HSI32/HSI64 与 Cache off/on；基础选择提供有限 USART3 TX DMA 或 RX DMA-IDLE、可选已初始化 D2 "
"SRAM1 和所选 SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/IWDG/Flash；独立 V 修订／HSI64／裸机／AXI SRAM 选择提供 USART3 连续 RX，"
"或有限 TX DMA 与连续 RX 的双向模式；Flash 要求 Cache off；不提供运行态交接"

msgid "U575ZI-Q default reference"
msgstr "U575ZI-Q 默认参考"

msgid ""
"Externally established TZEN=0/SWAP_BANK=0 and MSIS4; default IRQ-byte UART "
"plus GPIO/IWDG and selected finite SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/Flash; separate "
"USART1 selections provide finite SRAM1 GPDMA TX or a bounded hardware TX "
"chain, with IRQ-byte RX; external ADC supply admission; no RX DMA or "
"dual-domain factory"
msgstr ""
"外部已建立 TZEN=0/SWAP_BANK=0 与 MSIS4；默认 IRQ-byte UART，加 GPIO/IWDG 和所选有限 "
"SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/Flash；独立 USART1 选择提供有限 SRAM1 GPDMA TX 或有界硬件 TX 链，RX 保持 IRQ bytes；"
"ADC 供电由外部准入；不提供 RX DMA 或双域 factory"

msgid "U575 separate dual-domain reference"
msgstr "U575 独立双域参考"

msgid ""
"TZEN=1, no OS; synchronous scalar gateway and copied cooperative jobs of at "
"most eight PC7 commands in Secure storage; no retained NS pointer or generic"
" asynchronous cross-domain transport"
msgstr ""
"TZEN=1、无 OS；同步 scalar gateway 与最多八条 PC7 命令复制到 Secure 存储的 cooperative job；不保留"
" NS 指针，不提供通用异步跨域 transport"

msgid "CPU-only Runtime"
msgstr "CPU-only Runtime"

msgid ""
"M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85 Core/Arch and selected baremetal/FreeRTOS "
"software profiles; no generated SoC/Board/factory"
msgstr ""
"M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85 Core/Arch 及选定裸机/FreeRTOS 软件配置；不生成 "
"SoC/Board/factory"

msgid ""
"ThreadX currently maintains Native Linux GNU and M4 GNU profiles; it does "
"not inherit the FreeRTOS Cortex-M, MPU, split-security or tickless matrix. "
"Platform startup does not enter either kernel. The application owns "
"scheduler startup."
msgstr ""
"ThreadX 当前维护 Native Linux GNU 与 M4 GNU 配置；不继承 FreeRTOS Cortex-M、MPU、分裂安全状态或 "
"tickless 矩阵。平台启动不进入任何内核。应用拥有调度器启动。"

msgid ""
"![CPU primitive, runtime, SoC and physical qualification "
"boundaries](../../assets/diagrams/cortex-m-capabilities.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![CPU 原语、runtime、SoC 与物理资格边界](../../assets/diagrams/cortex-m-"
"capabilities.svg)"

msgid "CPU primitive, runtime, SoC and physical qualification boundaries"
msgstr "CPU 原语、runtime、SoC 与物理资格边界"

msgid ""
"FIG-13 separates CPU software coverage from exact SoC integration and "
"physical acceptance. FPU, DSP, Cache, MVE, SAU and IRQ width are explicit "
"required facts; a CPU name never enables an optional capability "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"FIG-13 分开 CPU 软件覆盖、精确 SoC 接入和物理验收。FPU、DSP、缓存、MVE、SAU 和 IRQ 优先级位宽必须作为明确事实；CPU"
" 名称绝不自动启用可选能力。"

msgid "Check a selection before using it"
msgstr "使用前核对选择"

msgid ""
"Find the exact full part and Board package, including unknown physical "
"facts."
msgstr "确认精确完整料号与 Board 包，包括未知物理事实。"

msgid ""
"Inspect the selected controller route and mode in the capability matrix."
msgstr "在能力矩阵核对选定控制器路由与模式。"

msgid ""
"Resolve the actual complete assembly; unsupported modes and conflicts "
"reject."
msgstr "解析实际完整 assembly；不支持模式和冲突会拒绝。"

msgid ""
"Check software evidence for its exact source/configuration, not a nearby "
"tuple."
msgstr "核对精确源码/配置的软件证据，不能使用近似组合。"

msgid "Check an actual station record before claiming physical behavior."
msgstr "声明物理行为前核对实际工位记录。"

msgid ""
"All maintained MCU physical HIL remains not executed in the current records."
" Default Board bindings do not cover every connector, transceiver or "
"external part. Finite block modes include rearm gaps. Continuous modes need "
"explicit replacement storage and service budgets; they do not promise "
"losslessness under arbitrary load. Flash geometry is physical, while product"
" partitions and update policy are external. ECC `program_flags` can require "
"proven fresh erase before each program unit; all-FF readback cannot "
"establish erased ECC history. Every started pulse settles before return, and"
" deadlines only prevent later pulses. These source mechanisms and their "
"developer tests do not inherit final qualification from historical results. "
"Exact current-source software execution is recorded separately."
msgstr ""
"当前记录中全部维护 MCU 的物理 HIL 均未执行。默认 Board binding 不覆盖每个 connector、transceiver "
"或外部器件。有限 block 模式有 rearm 间隙；连续模式也需显式替换存储与 service 预算，不保证任意负载下无丢失。Flash "
"geometry 是物理事实，产品分区和升级策略由外部负责。ECC `program_flags` 可以要求每个编程单元有可证明的新擦除；全 FF "
"读回不能证明 ECC 擦除历史。每个已启动脉冲先排空再返回，deadline "
"只阻止后续脉冲。这些源机制及开发测试不继承历史结果的最终资格；精确当前源码的软件执行另行记录。"

msgid ""
"![Selected U575 synchronous Secure/NonSecure "
"reference](../../assets/diagrams/u575-security-domains.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![选定 U575 同步 Secure/NonSecure 参考](../../assets/diagrams/u575-security-"
"domains.svg)"

msgid "Selected U575 synchronous Secure/NonSecure reference"
msgstr "选定 U575 同步 Secure/NonSecure 参考"

msgid ""
"FIG-14 applies only to its declared TZEN=1 synchronous reference. It does "
"not change the default TZEN=0 Platform configuration or establish physical "
"isolation. Read [qualification](qualification.md) before treating any "
"software result as a release."
msgstr ""
"FIG-14 仅适用其声明的 TZEN=1 同步参考。不改变默认 TZEN=0 Platform "
"配置，也不建立物理隔离。把软件结果视为发布前先阅读[资格](qualification.md)。"

#: docs/reference/platforms/support.md:29
msgid ""
"The [F103 source boundary](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f103/README.md) separates the CPU-"
"readable 128 KiB Flash-density check from its declared orderable part. ES096"
" section2.2.2 prevents normal firmware from observing the debug-only device "
"group and revision. Standalone startup does not require a debugger, and an "
"unavailable zero read cannot establish a reviewed silicon revision."
msgstr ""
"[F103 来源边界](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f103/README.md) 将 CPU 可读的 128 KiB Flash "
"密度检查与配置声明的完整料号分开。ES096 第 2.2.2 "
"节说明，正常固件不能观测仅调试模式可读的设备组和修订。独立启动不要求连接调试器，也不能凭不可用的零读取值建立已审硅片修订。"
